<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head><meta charset="utf-8"><title>Multi-factor authentication enabled</title></head>
<body style="font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', sans-serif; max-width: 600px; margin: 2em auto; color: #1a1a1a;">
  <h1 style="font-size: 20px;">Multi-factor authentication enabled</h1>
  <p>Hi,</p>
  <p>Multi-factor authentication is now enabled on your ShopFlow account (<strong>{user_email}</strong>). Enrollment completed at {occurred_at_utc} UTC.</p>
  <p>From your next login you'll be prompted for a 6-digit code from your authenticator app after entering your password.</p>
  <p style="background: #fff8e1; padding: 12px 16px; border-left: 4px solid #ffa000; margin: 1em 0;"><strong>Keep your recovery codes somewhere safe</strong> — they're the only way back into your account if you lose access to your authenticator app.</p>
  <p style="color: #666; font-size: 14px;">If you didn't enroll MFA yourself, contact your Owner immediately.</p>
  <p style="color: #999; font-size: 12px; margin-top: 2em;">— ShopFlow WMS Security</p>
</body>
</html>
